SUMMARY:Unionville Day: Nature walk + Art + Shopping  + Dinner + Markham J
 azz Festival
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Saturday August 22nd**\, **join us fo
 r a Day in Unionville and be part of the Markham Jazz Festival. The day wi
 ll feature: an Art Gallery Tour\, Nature Scenic Walk\, Shopping/Sightseein
 g on Main Street\, Dinner\, then concerts on the Millennium Bandstand Stag
 e. The final concert will have a mix of musical genres to get you dancing.
  Then\, relax on your drive back home.**\n\n**ITINERARY**\n**2:50pm: Meet 
 outside the [Frederick Horsman Varley Art Gallery](http://www.markham.ca/M
 arkham/Attractions/Gallery/) (Varley is a Group of Seven Member)**\n**3:00
 p: Guided tour of the Varley Art Gallery**\n**3:30p: A scenic walk through
  Too Good Pond Park**\n**4:00 - 5:15pm: Sight-seeing/ shopping (Main stree
 t is a short block)**\n**5:15pm: Dinner**\n**6:45pm: Head over to Millenni
 um Bandstage for final 2 concerts**\n\n**Note**: **you will need to arrang
 e your own transportation to and from\, and confirm if you will be joining
  for dinner\, as reservations are required. In addition\, all out of town 
 events require your cell and email.**\n\n**TRANSPORTATION**:\n\n* Arrange 
 for your own transportation. Feel free to post in the Comments if you want
 /need to carpool.\n* **Carpool attendees MUST have a picture and arrange a
